      <title>Trump's UN Bluster Didn't Scare Xi, Putin or Iran</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-27/trump-s-un-bluster-didn-t-scare-xi-putin-or-iran</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">167684d564701d9dcbbde155</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:17 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Donald Trump loves playing the tough guy. The president postured from the podium at the United Nations this week. He threatened to send the Iranian regime “into hell”; he gloated about his appropriation of Venezuelan oil, declaring, “to the victor belong the spoils.”</description>
